/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (The practice of clinical pharmacy in India has undergone a tremendous transformation from being a product-oriented discipline to a patient-oriented health care service. The development of pharmaceutical education and the greater involvement of clinical pharmacists in multidisciplinary healthcare teams have strengthened pharmaceutical care services around the country. Modern clinical pharmacy is centered on medication therapy management, pharmacovigilance, patient counseling, therapeutic drug monitoring and evidence-based clinical interventions to improve patient safety and therapeutic outcomes. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Clinical pharmacists are an important contributor to the optimization of pharmacotherapy, drug-related problems, medication adherence and healthcare quality through ward rounds, antimicrobial stewardship programs and clinical research. Innovations like digital health technologies, personalized medicine are also broadening the spectrum of pharmacy practice in India. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (There are still challenges in terms of professional recognition, lack of supporting infrastructure and regulatory barriers to integrating clinical pharmacy services into the healthcare system, despite progress and recognition of the value of clinical pharmacy services. However, the growing awareness of patient safety, increasing burden of chronic diseases and ongoing healthcare reforms provide enough scope for expansion of clinical pharmacy in the hospitals, academia, pharmacovigilance, research and community healthcare. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (In conclusion clinical pharmacy is emerging as an integral part of modern healthcare in India. Enhancing education, healthcare policies, and interprofessional collaboration will be essential for the advancement of patient-centered pharmaceutical care and the improvement of health care outcomes in general. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
